    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is rank one and can raise a Gu Master’s strength by one jin. The same shop lists it beside strength of ten jin Gu and Jun Strength Gu, and states that one jun is thirty jin. Among strength path Gu, jin strength Gu, jun strength Gu, and beast strength Gu make up most of what is on offer, and most of them are for attacking.",
