          "sys_gu_immortal",
          "gu_jun_strength_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The human strength jun strength branch refers to Jin Strength Gu, strength of ten jin Gu, Jun Strength Gu, strength of ten jun Gu, strength of hundred jun Gu, and others. In Northern Plains that branch is already the mainstream strength path cultivation, and Gu Masters there are said to have used Jin Strength Gu and the rest of that line.",
        "chapters": [
          754
        ],
